    {
      "id": "de",
      "title": "Noun 1 + 的 + noun 2: possession",
      "summary": "的 (de) = 's / of. With close people and places after a pronoun it's usually dropped: 我妈妈, 我们学校.",
      "body": "- 老师**的**车 (the teacher's car).\n- 我**的**书 (my book).\n- 我妈妈, 你家, 我们公司 — no 的 needed.\n- Don't confuse with 得 / 地 (same sound, other grammar).",
