          "{这|zhè}{是|shì}{老师|lǎoshī}{的|de}{车|chē}。",
          "This is the teacher's car."
        ],
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{妈妈|māma}{是|shì}{医生|yīshēng}。",
          "My mum is a doctor."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "he",
      "title": "Noun 1 + 和 + noun 2",
      "summary": "和 (hé) = 'and' between **nouns** (or pronouns) only. To link verbs, adjectives or clauses use 也, 还, 又….",
      "body": "- 我**和**我妹妹 (my sister and I).\n- ~~他很高和很帅~~ ✗ → 他很高，也很帅.",
      "examples": [
